{"version":1,"content":"<p>視后佘詩曼入行近30年，憑劇集《新聞女王》「Man姐」一角再創事業巔峰，吸金力驚人的她坐擁多個物業，更是身家破億的圈中「黃金盛女」。</p><p>雖然感情生活暫時未有着落，但阿佘的單身貴族生活同樣精彩，私下對待後輩更是出了名的豪爽與體貼。</p><p>&lt;br/&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:44:02.177635+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T03:18:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T03:39:30.878625+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T03:39:30.878625+00:00","content_hash":"38e6ae0fbb2cfb79b021d4f6f7c443202d1e9cbe44dfd3405c8fbcc8f7dcb672","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}